   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MC WARDROBE \u2014 clothing change via keyframe pair (Wan 2.2 FLF)\n\nWHAT THIS DOES\nRenders an ACTED clothing change: KEYFRAME A (dressed) is the\nfirst frame, KEYFRAME B (changed \u2014 garment in hand / on floor)\nis the last frame. WanFirstLastFrameToVideo forces the model to\ninvent the physical action that connects the two states, guided\nby the motion prompt.\n\nQUICK START\n1) Upload KEYFRAME A (the 'before' still, 9:16 portrait).\n2) Build KEYFRAME B with Qwen-Edit \u2014 see note \u2462 for the recipe.\n3) Write the motion prompt from the template in note \u2463.\n4) Queue. Output \u2192 output/aiofm_wardrobe/.\n\nVERTICAL 9:16 \u00b7 UPSCALE-AFTER POLICY\nGeneration is fixed at 480\u00d7832 \u00b7 81 frames \u00b7 16 fps (RIFE \u2192 32).\nDo NOT raise W/H here \u2014 wardrobe changes need 2\u20135 attempts, so\niterate cheap at 480\u00d7832 and upscale ONLY the winning take\nafterwards (SeedVR2 / topaz / your upscale workflow). Rendering\nevery attempt at 720p wastes 3\u00d7 GPU time on rejects."
   ],
   "title": "\u2460 READ ME \u2014 MC WARDROBE",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    -1040,
    -620
   ],
   "size": [
    480,
    520
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 21,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "REQUIRED FILES \u2014 all ON THE VOLUME already:\n\ndiffusion_models/\n  wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n  wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors\ntext_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors\nvae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\nloras/wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_{high,low}_noise\nloras/f1sher_000002400.safetensors (default character LoRA \u2014\n  swap for your model's LoRA, strength 0.6\u20130.9)\nRIFE rife49.pth auto-downloads on first queue.\n\nCHARACTER LoRA SLOTS are BYPASSED (purple) by default. Select\nboth \u2192 Ctrl+B to enable. Keep HIGH and LOW strengths equal.\n\nCLIP VISION \u2014 intentionally NOT connected. Wan 2.2 FLF runs\nfine without it (clip_vision_start/end_image are optional).\nclip_vision_h.safetensors is NOT on the volume (NEW DOWNLOAD\nif you ever want to experiment \u2014 the sigclip file that IS on\nthe volume is for Flux Redux, NOT compatible with Wan)."
   ],
   "title": "\u2461 MODELS",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
